# Generated by deploy/deploy.py from `cloud.vps.domain`, and overwritten on
# every deploy of the cloud proxy — edit the config, not this file.
#
# It used to be committed with `chat.home` in it, which is an internal
# name and the one thing a public host cannot be called, so everybody had to
# hand-edit it before pasting it in.
#
# After a deploy, the real one is beside this service on the VPS. Append it to
# /etc/caddy/Caddyfile and `systemctl reload caddy`. It is not installed for
# you: that file belongs to the machine, and may already terminate TLS for
# vhosts this stack knows nothing about.
